*begin leverswatermineandbrowstopetotoplevel

*export entrance 1x 48old cairn

*title "Coniston Copper Mines - Leverswater Mine via Brow Stope to connect to Top Level extensions"
*date 2022.03.05
*team Photography Becka Lawson
*team Instruments Philip Withnall
*team Notes Neil Pacey
*instrument Becka1 Distox2

; Neil GPS at cairn ie leverswatermineandbrowstopetotoplevel.cairn between two entrances was SD 28014 99044 and 425m elevation with 10 foot accuracy; using satellite image and OS app I get 2801 9904 and altitude 424 so very similar. See also the GPS in the toplevel file for station 1x in this file which is the same station as toplevel1.1

; stations from Distox2 download had to be renumbered in order to match paper notes; original download file is also saved in same folder as "DONOTUSE-Leverswater-BrowStopeTopLevel-PlusTopLevel1" and "DONOTUSE-PARTIAL-LeversWaterMine+BrowStope-FromAutosave.svx"

;*calibrate tape 0	; +ve if tape was too short, -ve if too long

;from	to	tape	compass	clino	remarks

*equate 3 entrance

